<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Job Offer Letter</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:15mm}body{font:12px Arial;line-height:1.4}.letter{max-width:800px;margin:auto}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #000;padding-bottom:10px}.tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px 0}.tbl th,.tbl td{border:1px solid #000;padding:6px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:11px}.tbl th{background:#f5f5f5}.line{display:inline-block;min-width:200px;border-bottom:1px solid #000}.sign{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:40px}.signature{width:200px;text-align:center}.signature-line{border-top:1px solid #000;margin-top:40px;padding-top:5px}</style></head><body><div class="letter"><div class="head"><div><b>Reference No:</b> {{$offer->reference_no}}</div><div><b>Date:</b> {{$offer->offer_date?->format('d/m/Y')}}</div></div><p><b>To:</b> <span class="line">{{$offer->candidate_name}}</span></p><p>Your Application dated <span class="line">{{$offer->application_date?->format('d/m/Y')??$offer->offer_date?->format('d/m/Y')}}</span> refers you have been selected based on the following terms and condition:</p><table class="tbl"><tr><th style="width:5%">S.NO</th><th style="width:20%">CLAUSES</th><th style="width:75%">EFFECTS</th></tr><tr><td>01</td><td><b>Position</b></td><td>You are appointed as <span class="line">{{$offer->position}}</span> Department <span class="line">{{$offer->department}}</span></td></tr><tr><td>02</td><td><b>Remuneration</b></td><td>Your basic salary will be Rs. <span class="line">{{number_format((float)$offer->basic_salary,2)}}</span> per month.<br>In case of extra time and off day working you will be given overtime as per school policy.</td></tr><tr><td>03</td><td><b>Date of Joining</b></td><td>You are advised to report for duty to the School Head on <span class="line">{{$offer->joining_date?->format('d/m/Y')}}</span>, failing which this offer letter shall be treated as cancelled.</td></tr><tr><td>04</td><td><b>Nature of Job</b></td><td>The appointment shall be temporary, on probation for one month with effect from the date of joining. Your service can be terminated any time without assigning any reason during probationary period. You shall be entitled to salary and benefits as per school rules.</td></tr><tr><td>05</td><td><b>Terms and Conditions</b></td><td>You shall be governed by school rules and regulations. During probation, leave may be unpaid. You must maintain confidentiality, bring original testimonials and provide a medical fitness certificate.</td></tr></table><p>Please review the contents of this offer carefully. If acceptable, sign and return one fully signed copy by <span class="line">{{$offer->joining_date?->format('d/m/Y')}}</span>.</p><p>Miss/Mr. <span class="line">{{$offer->candidate_name}}</span>, we welcome the possibility of you joining us.</p><p><b>Yours truly</b></p><div class="sign"><div class="signature"><div class="signature-line"><b>Principal</b></div></div><div style="text-align:right">I agree to accept the conditions above.<p style="margin-top:30px"><span class="line" style="min-width:300px"></span><br><b>Signature</b></p></div></div></div></body></html>
